-- A regression guard: `y = x?` and then `y` and `x` in the same
-- position make `x`'s type contain itself, whichever shape `?` settles on
-- — an infinite type, not a `?` defaulted into a cycle. It is reported at
-- the binder `x`, as `a = Result b a` (checker-v2.md §8.6).
--
f x =
    y = x?
    if True then
        y
    else
        x
